==Description==
'''Egg''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[Duck Hunt Event]] in the [[D00M's Revenge]] map. 

It was used to complete Ranks on the [[Duck Hunt Event#Hunting Season Pass|Hunting Season Pass]]. Every time a rank was earned, the amount of '''Egg''' obtained were reset.

It took the appearance of an egg.

